---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const basePath = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const baseUrl = basePath.endsWith('/') ? basePath : basePath + '/';
---

<BaseLayout title="Climbing - Moi">
  <div class="container-custom py-16">
    <div class="surface-card relative mx-auto max-w-4xl overflow-hidden p-8 md:p-12">
      <svg class="page-sketch right-4 top-4 hidden h-32 w-40 md:block" viewBox="0 0 160 120" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 98L48 56L70 78L108 30L148 98" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <path d="M28 98L58 74L78 88L108 52L132 98" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      </svg>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Climbing Info</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Climbing has taught me focus, patience, and problem-solving beyond the keyboard. As an instructor, I aim to help others find that same mental clarity and physical challenge.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">My Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          I coach climbers from beginner to intermediate levels, focusing on body awareness, footwork, and reading the rock. Whether in the gym training on plastic, or heading outside for real rock, safety and steady progression are core to my teaching method.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Qualifications</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                <a href="https://www.mountain-training.org/qualifications/climbing/rock-climbing-instructor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="accent-link underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Rock Climbing Instructor</a>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                Qualified means I can teach indoors/outdoors/sport/trad so long as it is single-pitch and not a sea cliff.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
                <a href="https://www.mountain-training.org/qualifications/walking/mountain-leader/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="accent-link underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Mountain Leader Trainee</a>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                Working towards becoming a mountain leader, allowing for the leading of camping and walking in the mountains.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <img src={`${baseUrl}mt-cymru-logo-full.png`} alt="Mountain Training Logo" class="w-32 h-32 shrink-0 object-contain rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm" />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Booking a Session</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          I currently hold regular sessions locally. If you're interested in climbing instruction or want some tips on breaking into the sport, get in touch through my <a href={`${baseUrl}contact/`} class="accent-link underline-offset-4">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
